fram+xAct, SymPy, Sage+bundled Singular 4.4.1, and pinned Lean 4.31/mathlib passed frozen run-adjudicate. A fresh observed Astra/xhigh reviewer returned PASS_FINITE_COMPONENT_REVIEW, verified 235 sealed files, and independently compiled the full Lean proof once with core axioms only. All four authors used observed Sol/high; correlation and preserved failures are disclosed.\n\nOnly this C02 directory is included. The original CAS_CONFLICT, Singular error despite exit 0, native capacity failures, enum rejection, and intermediate interactive Lean exact-replay UNKNOWN are retained. Raw Wolfram/Singular whitespace warnings remain unchanged; the separate check of all other source/docs passes.\n\nJacobi/Volterra existence, curvature-to-majorization, C01/C03 error algebra, scalar monotonicity/Taylor remainder, full finite-distance physics/observations, and scientific admission remain HOLD. This PR does not merge, install, activate, rerun completed neighboring components, or change the existing checkout HEAD/index or unrelated user data.","created_at":"2026-10-05T08:48:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T08:48:07Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cosmosapjw-quantum/htt_base/pulls/479/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cosmosapjw-quantum/htt_base/pulls/479/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cosmosapjw-quantum/htt_base/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cosmosapjw-quantum/htt_base/issues/479/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cosmosapjw-quantum/htt_base/statuses/d5d129e529be0f432b4b4b433927ffe6dc329fac","head":{"label":"cosmosapjw-quantum:proof/cas07-c02-codex-only-20261005","ref":"proof/cas07-c02-codex-only-20261005","sha":"d5d129e529be0f432b4b4b433927ffe6dc329fac","user":{"login":"cosmosapjw-quantum","id"